(14, 6, 'NC-HOM-6002', 'drip-coffee-maker-900ml', 'Drip Coffee Maker 900ml', 'KitchenPro', 'Programmable drip brewing with a 900ml glass carafe and keep-warm plate.', 'Brew up to seven cups on a schedule with a bloom-first cycle, reusable filter, anti-drip valve and glass carafe.', 5499.00, 7999.00, 37, 8, 4.50, 412, 'New', 0, 0, 'active', 'coffee', '#B45309', JSON_ARRAY('Seven-cup 900ml carafe', 'Programmable timer', 'Keep-warm plate', 'Reusable filter', 'Anti-drip valve'), JSON_OBJECT('Capacity', '900ml or 7 cups', 'Power', '950W', 'Programmable', 'Yes up to 24 hours', 'Carafe', 'Glass', 'Keep warm', 'Automatic 40 minutes'), JSON_ARRAY('kitchen', 'coffee', 'brewing'), 'Ships in 3-5 business days. Free delivery on orders above INR 999.', '2026-06-14 10:00:00.000000'),
